--     through -62.1 -389.3 46.0 and -63.5 -389.9 45.6 (steps 52-53, refused 'no walkable path') and -106.7 -405.3
--     33.3 (step 54, no-progress: the server's path ended at the lead). The leg is 420 steps (was 487): from the pit
